{"unit_id":"yejiming__dsh-ppt#feature-1","repo":"yejiming/dsh-ppt","commit":"6b4e8f640334bc59725fa7bb2180eb93522e8ccf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH PPT 的「大纲与设计计划」功能：校验幻灯片结构和可选的艺术指导信息，并保存 outline.json 与 design-plan.json。通过 ppt_outline 工具提交标题和页面内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:432"]}
